  "definitions_zh_TW": [
    {
      "text": "1.阻隔不通。[例]堵塞、阻塞、閉塞\n2.滿、實。[例]充塞\n3.推託、應付。[例]搪塞、塞責",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5592",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.封口或填堵的東西。[例]瓶塞、活塞、軟木塞\n2.受阻不暢。[例]塞車\n3.填滿空隙。[例]塞滿食物、塞住洞口　◎",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5600",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.險要的地方。[例]要塞\n2.邊境。[例]邊塞、塞外",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5601",
      "verbatim": true
    }
  ],
